hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1637","\n Muhammad bin Bashshar and Yahya bin Hakim narrated to us, saying: 'Abd al-Wahhab narrated to us. [In another chain]: 'Imran bin Musa al-Qazzaz narrated to us, 'Abd al-Warith narrated to us. [In a third chain]: Abu Hashim Ziyad bin Ayub narrated to us, Isma'il (meaning Ibn 'Ulayyah) narrated to us. All three chains report from Ayub, from Abu al-'Aliyah al-Bara', who said"
